1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,285
这是一个问奶酪专家的问题
Here's a question for a cheese expert:

2
00:00:02,285 --> 00:00:06,315
描述一下，在授课老师的书里，奶酪制作在哪些地方很重要
describe where cheese making is important in the instructor's book.

3
00:00:06,635 --> 00:00:10,992
在课程团队录下的那次运行里，回答之前先打印了这两行
In the staff's recorded run, these two lines print before the answer:

4
00:00:10,992 --> 00:00:14,528
一个叫 get book by author 的函数，以及它的参数
a function called get_book_by_author, and its arguments.

5
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:19,253
返回了 10 个段落，全都来自同一本书，按作者过滤
Ten passages came back, all from one book, filtered by author.

6
00:00:19,573 --> 00:00:22,267
但 Gemini 跑在 Google 的数据中心
But Gemini runs in Google's data center,

7
00:00:22,267 --> 00:00:24,288
在那里 localhost 毫无意义
where localhost means nothing.

8
00:00:24,608 --> 00:00:27,509
所以，是谁搜索了你的数据库，又是谁选了这本书？
So who searched your database, and who chose the book?

9
00:00:27,750 --> 00:00:30,026
课上问的是一个更大的版本
The lecture asks a bigger version:

10
00:00:30,026 --> 00:00:34,577
规划在巴黎的五天，并且在下雨或航班延误时重新规划
plan five days in Paris, and replan if it rains or a flight is late.

11
00:00:34,897 --> 00:00:39,355
模型能起草一份计划，RAG 能取回事实，但两者都没法行动
A model can draft a plan, and RAG can fetch facts, but neither can act.

12
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:44,843
缺的是：实时系统、能行动的工具，以及自主决定的能力
What's missing: live systems, tools that act, and the autonomy to decide.

13
00:00:45,083 --> 00:00:47,643
今天我们分三步，一步步向它靠近
Today we climb toward that in three steps.

14
00:00:47,963 --> 00:00:50,100
先手写，用 llm-rag 的 agent
By hand, with llm-rag's agent;

15
00:00:50,100 --> 00:00:53,591
再用框架，Google 的 Agent Development Kit
with a framework, Google's Agent Development Kit;

16
00:00:53,591 --> 00:00:56,369
最后用 harness，在 Colab notebook 里
and with a harness, in Colab notebooks.

17
00:00:57,417 --> 00:01:02,985
左上角的进度条显示当前步骤；右上角的灰色标签标出对应的课件
The tracker, top left, shows the step; the gray tag, top right, names the lecture slides.

18
00:01:03,305 --> 00:01:06,654
看到黄色的 your turn 标签就暂停，自己跑一遍命令
Pause at each yellow your-turn tag, and run the command.

19
00:01:14,400 --> 00:01:19,426
你需要第 5 讲的数据库和密钥，Docker、uv、Node
You'll need the database and key from lecture 5, Docker, uv, Node,

20
00:01:19,426 --> 00:01:22,852
再加两个密钥：一个来自 Google AI Studio
and two more keys: one from Google AI Studio,

21
00:01:22,852 --> 00:01:25,365
一个来自 OpenAI，并且开通计费
one from OpenAI, with billing on.

22
00:01:26,600 --> 00:01:31,037
我们在 2026 年 10 月 18 日录制，没有任何密钥
We recorded on October 18, 2026, without keys.

23
00:01:31,357 --> 00:01:32,992
Docker、Chroma、uv
Docker, Chroma, uv,

24
00:01:32,992 --> 00:01:37,467
ADK 的 web 服务器和两个 MCP server，都是真实运行的
the ADK web server and two MCP servers ran for real;

25
00:01:37,467 --> 00:01:41,597
每次模型调用都没发出去就停了，或者被拒绝了
every model call stopped unsent, or was refused.

26
00:01:41,917 --> 00:01:44,563
模型的回答都是课程团队保存的输出
Model answers are the staff's saved outputs.

27
00:01:44,800 --> 00:01:48,448
画面上我们隐去了授课老师的名字；你的终端里会显示
On screen we hide the instructor's name; your terminal shows it.

28
00:01:48,768 --> 00:01:53,056
每条命令都在学习指南里，就在 MLOps Learning 这个 repo 里
Every command is in the study guide, in the MLOps_Learning repo.

29
00:01:55,100 --> 00:01:57,361
先讲概念，在 Cheese Quiz 里
First the ideas, in the Cheese Quiz.

30
00:01:57,681 --> 00:01:59,196
点 Save a copy in Drive
Save a copy in Drive,

31
00:01:59,196 --> 00:02:04,100
再在 Secrets 面板里用画面上的名字添加你的 OpenAI 密钥
then add your OpenAI key in the Secrets panel, under the name shown,

32
00:02:04,100 --> 00:02:05,831
并打开 Notebook access
with notebook access on.

33
00:02:06,067 --> 00:02:11,084
安装单元格装两个包，没有 pin 版本，还隐藏了全部输出
The install cell installs two packages, unpinned, and hides all output:

34
00:02:11,084 --> 00:02:14,899
如果后面 import 失败，就去掉那个重定向再跑一次
if imports fail later, rerun it without that redirect.

35
00:02:15,219 --> 00:02:18,568
然后下载测验文件，暂停一下，把准备工作跑一遍
Then download the quiz files, and pause to run the setup.

36
00:02:20,817 --> 00:02:23,610
现在 notebook 用三种方式问同一个问题
Now the notebook asks one question three ways,

37
00:02:23,610 --> 00:02:28,710
每次都用同一个模型：做烤奶酪三明治，最好用哪种奶酪？
with the same model each time: what's the best cheese for a grilled cheese sandwich?

38
00:02:29,030 --> 00:02:30,971
第 1 条通道，基础 LLM
Lane 1, the base LLM:

39
00:02:30,971 --> 00:02:35,686
调用 gpt-4o 一次，一个回答，不到 3 秒
one call to gpt-4o, one answer, in under 3 seconds.

40
00:02:35,933 --> 00:02:40,498
第 2 条通道，推理 LLM：几个 Python 方法按固定的顺序运行
Lane 2, the reasoning LLM: Python methods run in a fixed order.

41
00:02:40,818 --> 00:02:46,280
分析，拆成 4 个子问题，逐个回答并验证，最后合并
Analyze, split into 4 sub-questions, answer and verify each, then combine.

42
00:02:46,600 --> 00:02:51,763
一共 11 次调用、39 秒，而它的 token 总数只是估算
That's 11 calls and 39 seconds, and its token total is only an estimate.

43
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:56,267
课上把这种多次调用的系统叫作推理引擎
The lecture calls a multi-call system like this a reasoning engine.

44
00:02:56,587 --> 00:02:58,586
这里由你的 Python 安排调用顺序
Here your Python orders the calls,

45
00:02:58,586 --> 00:03:01,643
所以它是推理工作流，不是推理模型
so it's a reasoning workflow, not a reasoning model.

46
00:03:02,883 --> 00:03:04,383
第 3 条通道，agent
Lane 3, the agent:

47
00:03:04,383 --> 00:03:09,923
同一个模型，加上指令和一个 OpenAI 托管的网页搜索工具
the same model, plus instructions and a web search tool that OpenAI hosts.

48
00:03:10,243 --> 00:03:15,320
它的回答显示做了两次搜索，13 秒后它自己停了下来
Its answer reports two searches, and it stopped on its own after 13 seconds.

49
00:03:15,640 --> 00:03:17,716
它还显示用了一个工具
It also reports one tool used,

50
00:03:17,716 --> 00:03:20,761
但这个数统计的是配置的工具，不是调用次数
but that counts tools configured, not calls.

51
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:23,025
课上对 agent 的定义是
The lecture defines an agent

52
00:03:23,025 --> 00:03:29,171
一个 LLM，给它指令和工具，它自己运行，直到任务完成
as an LLM, given instructions and tools, that runs on its own until the task is done.

53
00:03:29,491 --> 00:03:34,803
它的五个组件里，有一个决定下一步：动态控制，也就是方向盘
Of its five blocks, one decides the next step: dynamic control, the steering wheel.

54
00:03:35,050 --> 00:03:39,935
所以 agent 并不是更聪明的模型：三条通道用的是同一个模型
So an agent isn't a smarter model: the model was the same in all three lanes.

55
00:03:40,255 --> 00:03:42,687
变的是谁掌方向盘，还有工具
What changed is who steers, and the tools.

56
00:03:43,007 --> 00:03:46,271
每次调用都要付费；暂停一下，把三条通道都跑一遍
Every call is paid; pause, and run the three lanes.

57
00:03:49,317 --> 00:03:52,112
下一节：管理模型的输入
Next section: managing the model's inputs.

58
00:03:52,432 --> 00:03:54,522
LLM 是无状态的函数
LLMs are stateless functions.

59
00:03:54,842 --> 00:03:59,088
每次调用都是一个全新的信封，模型只知道信封里的东西
Every call is a fresh envelope, and the model knows only what's inside.

60
00:03:59,334 --> 00:04:04,177
这个 notebook 固定模型和问题，每一步改的是输入
The notebook keeps the model and question fixed, and changes the inputs each step.

61
00:04:04,497 --> 00:04:08,006
先是 system prompt、检索到的文档、之前几轮
A system prompt, retrieved documents, earlier turns,

62
00:04:08,006 --> 00:04:12,326
再是以往 session 的用户画像、工具的输出和输出 schema
a profile from past sessions, a tool's output, an output schema.

63
00:04:12,567 --> 00:04:14,314
注意看首选的变化
Watch the top pick change:

64
00:04:14,314 --> 00:04:18,348
切达、美式奶酪，然后是给孩子吃的温和奶酪，再然后是哈瓦蒂
cheddar, American, then mild cheeses for kids, then Havarti.

65
00:04:18,668 --> 00:04:21,096
接着是 Whole Foods 的一款温和切达
Then a mild cheddar from Whole Foods,

66
00:04:21,096 --> 00:04:23,788
最后是同一个首选，写成严格的 JSON
and finally the same pick as strict JSON.

67
00:04:24,034 --> 00:04:26,295
第 4 步展示了记忆到底是什么
Step 4 shows what memory really is.

68
00:04:26,615 --> 00:04:30,989
之前几轮对话并不是模型记住的：代码每次都把它们重新发一遍
The earlier turns aren't remembered: the code sends them again, every time.

69
00:04:31,309 --> 00:04:34,018
记忆，就是你放回信封里的纸
Memory is paper you put back in the envelope.

70
00:04:34,267 --> 00:04:39,238
课上把这几页纸归成两个组件：指令和记忆
The lecture groups these sheets into two building blocks: instructions and memory.

71
00:04:39,558 --> 00:04:42,928
下节课会给这门手艺起个名字：上下文工程
Next lecture names the craft: context engineering.

72
00:04:43,167 --> 00:04:45,535
现在仔细看看第 2 步的代码
Now look closely at the code of step 2.

73
00:04:45,855 --> 00:04:47,455
你能找出这个小疏漏吗？
Can you spot the slip?

74
00:04:51,484 --> 00:04:54,051
这里 system prompt 用的角色是 user
The system prompt goes in with the role user,

75
00:04:54,051 --> 00:04:56,220
问题用的角色却是 system
and the question with the role system.

76
00:04:56,467 --> 00:05:00,755
先把这两个角色对调，再去比较；从第 3 步开始，它们就是对的
Swap those two roles before comparing; from step 3 on, they're right.

77
00:05:01,075 --> 00:05:03,059
暂停一下，把这七步跑一遍
Pause, and run the seven steps.

78
00:05:05,300 --> 00:05:09,929
再注意第 6 步：代码把一个工具的输出贴进了信封
And notice step 6: the code pasted a tool's output into the envelope.

79
00:05:10,249 --> 00:05:12,212
可是，模型要怎么请求一个工具呢？
But how does a model ask for a tool?

80
00:05:13,850 --> 00:05:19,226
在第 5 讲里，RAG 是一条直线：问题、检索、模型、回答
In lecture 5, RAG was a straight line: question, retrieval, model, response.

81
00:05:19,546 --> 00:05:22,227
课上的回顾让检索更聪明
The lecture's recap makes retrieval smarter:

82
00:05:22,227 --> 00:05:27,589
搜索前后的步骤、到底要不要检索、评分、改写，还有网页搜索
steps around the search, whether to retrieve at all, grading, rewriting, and web search.

83
00:05:27,833 --> 00:05:32,015
Agentic RAG 把一个模型放在这份菜单前面，让它来选
Agentic RAG puts a model in front of that menu, and lets it choose.

84
00:05:32,250 --> 00:05:37,029
在 llm-rag 里，Agents 一节就是菜单只有两项的 Agentic RAG
llm-rag's Agents section is Agentic RAG with a menu of two.

85
00:05:37,349 --> 00:05:40,997
它的 README 说：让 LLM 决定怎么检索
Its README says: let the LLM decide how to retrieve.

86
00:05:41,317 --> 00:05:44,005
搜一位作者的书，或者搜全部的书
Search one author's book, or search all books.

87
00:05:44,250 --> 00:05:47,125
这是第一个菜单项，是手写的
Here's the first menu item, written by hand:

88
00:05:47,125 --> 00:05:50,981
一个名字，模型会把它写回来，还有一段描述
a name, which the model will write back, and a description;

89
00:05:50,981 --> 00:05:55,621
它和参数描述一起，是模型能看到的唯一文档
with the parameter descriptions, the only documentation the model sees.

90
00:05:55,941 --> 00:05:58,245
参数以 JSON schema 的形式给出
Parameters come as a JSON schema.

91
00:05:58,483 --> 00:06:01,363
作者必须是 enum 里 9 个名字之一
The author must be one of 9 names in an enum.

92
00:06:01,683 --> 00:06:05,075
搜索文本的描述甚至在指导模型
The search text's description even coaches the model:

93
00:06:05,075 --> 00:06:07,891
把搜索词扩展成一两句话
expand the search term to a sentence or two.

94
00:06:08,211 --> 00:06:09,918
而且两个字段都是必填的
And both fields are required.

95
00:06:10,167 --> 00:06:11,767
再看真正的函数
Now the real function.

96
00:06:11,980 --> 00:06:15,580
还有两个参数，collection 和一个 embedding 函数
Two more arguments, the collection and an embedding function,

97
00:06:15,580 --> 00:06:18,295
不在 schema 里：由你的代码提供
aren't in the schema: your code supplies them.

98
00:06:18,615 --> 00:06:21,857
模型能控制的只有作者和搜索文本
The model controls only the author and the search text.

99
00:06:24,200 --> 00:06:28,042
课上说，会用工具的 agent 必须选对工具
The lecture says a tool-using agent must pick the right tool,

100
00:06:28,042 --> 00:06:30,877
整理好输入格式，并解读输出
format its inputs, and interpret its outputs.

101
00:06:31,197 --> 00:06:34,405
在这里，模型选工具、整理格式，全靠写出来
Here the model picks and formats only by writing;

102
00:06:34,405 --> 00:06:36,005
运行工具的是你的代码
your code runs the tool.

103
00:06:36,217 --> 00:06:40,803
这是 collection 里的 11 本书，旁边是 enum 里的 9 个名字
Here are the 11 books in the collection, beside the 9 names in the enum.

104
00:06:50,650 --> 00:06:57,861
两本书。那本茅屋奶酪食谱，178 个 chunk，作者不在名单上
Two books. The cottage cheese recipe book, 178 chunks, has an author who isn't on the list.

105
00:06:58,181 --> 00:07:01,811
Woman's Institute 那本书，1505 个 chunk
The Woman's Institute book, 1,505 chunks,

106
00:07:01,811 --> 00:07:06,415
干脆没有作者：这是第 5 讲里那个文件名的小疏漏
has no author at all: a file name slip in lecture 5.

107
00:07:06,650 --> 00:07:09,807
这两本书仍然能通过搜索全部的书找到
Both stay reachable by the search across all books.

108
00:07:10,127 --> 00:07:12,805
现在看舞台：Gemini 在 Google 的云上
Now the stage: Gemini in Google's cloud,

109
00:07:12,805 --> 00:07:16,421
两个 container 在你的笔记本上，中间隔着一条边界
two containers on your laptop, and a boundary between.

110
00:07:16,667 --> 00:07:19,718
模型从来拿不到你的数据库，只拿到一份菜单
The model never gets your database, only a menu.

111
00:07:20,038 --> 00:07:23,643
第 1 次调用返回一张点单：函数名和参数
Call 1 returns an order: a function name and arguments.

112
00:07:23,963 --> 00:07:27,163
你的代码执行它；第 2 次调用把结果发回去
Your code runs it; call 2 sends back the result.

113
00:07:32,750 --> 00:07:36,334
第 5 讲停在了一条命令上；今天我们来运行它
Lecture 5 ended on one command; today we run it.

114
00:07:36,654 --> 00:07:38,076
从头开始？
Starting fresh?

115
00:07:38,126 --> 00:07:39,626
把 llm-rag clone 下来
Clone llm-rag,

116
00:07:39,626 --> 00:07:43,500
把服务账号密钥放进它旁边的 secrets 目录
and put the service account key in a secrets folder beside it;

117
00:07:43,500 --> 00:07:45,550
不是的话，就进到你的目录
otherwise, go to your folder.

118
00:07:45,783 --> 00:07:48,130
第 1 步：cd llm-rag
Step 1: cd llm-rag.

119
00:07:48,450 --> 00:07:50,898
第 2 步：编辑 docker-shell.sh
Step 2: edit docker-shell.sh,

120
00:07:50,898 --> 00:07:54,529
把 GCP project 变量改成你自己的项目 ID
and set GCP_PROJECT to your own project ID;

121
00:07:54,529 --> 00:07:56,386
我们用的是占位值
we used a placeholder.

122
00:07:56,706 --> 00:07:58,306
暂停一下，把两件事都做了
Pause, and do both.

123
00:08:00,267 --> 00:08:03,062
第 3 步：sh docker-shell.sh
Step 3: sh docker-shell.sh.

124
00:08:03,382 --> 00:08:05,152
Compose 先启动 Chroma
Compose starts Chroma first.

125
00:08:05,472 --> 00:08:09,452
后面那条 pull 的消息看起来像报错，其实无害
The pull message after it looks like an error but is harmless:

126
00:08:09,452 --> 00:08:12,725
网上没有这个 image，所以 Compose 自己构建
there's no such image online, so Compose builds it.

127
00:08:13,033 --> 00:08:16,190
构建大约 40 秒后，出现横幅
After about 40 seconds of building, the banner prints.

128
00:08:16,510 --> 00:08:23,081
录制时是 Python 3.12.15 和 uv 0.13.1
Python 3.12.15 and uv 0.13.1, at the time of recording.

129
00:08:23,401 --> 00:08:27,310
提示符里 @ 符号后面是 container ID，每次运行都不一样
After the at sign comes the container's ID, new every run;

130
00:08:27,310 --> 00:08:29,332
暂停一下，走到这个提示符
pause, and get to this prompt.

131
00:08:31,567 --> 00:08:35,023
在第二个终端里做一个额外检查：docker ps
An extra check from a second terminal: docker ps.

132
00:08:35,343 --> 00:08:39,673
Chroma 发布了 port 8000；记住这个 port，第二部分会用到
Chroma publishes port 8000; remember that port for part 2.

133
00:08:40,600 --> 00:08:43,529
现在是 Agents 一节的第 1 步
Now the Agents section, step 1:

134
00:08:43,529 --> 00:08:47,875
python cli.py --agent，chunk type 用 char-split
python cli.py --agent --chunk_type char-split.

135
00:08:48,195 --> 00:08:52,120
在新的 clone 上，它马上就失败：collection 不存在
On a fresh clone it fails at once: the collection does not exist.

136
00:08:52,440 --> 00:08:56,301
那是第 429 行，在任何 Gemini 调用之前
That's line 429, before any call to Gemini.

137
00:08:56,550 --> 00:08:59,387
这个 agent 需要第 5 讲的索引
The agent needs the index from lecture 5.

138
00:08:59,707 --> 00:09:01,307
那个数据库还留着吗？
Kept that database?

139
00:09:01,414 --> 00:09:03,687
它在 docker-volumes 目录里
It's in the docker-volumes/ folder;

140
00:09:03,687 --> 00:09:07,323
如果你是在 9 月 22 日之前分块的，先 pull，再重建它
if you chunked before September 22, pull and rebuild it.

141
00:09:07,643 --> 00:09:11,244
否则就重新分块、向量化、加载。我们没有密钥
Otherwise, chunk, embed and load again. We had no key,

142
00:09:11,244 --> 00:09:15,025
所以 embed 用的是课程团队 commit 过的 embedding
so the staff's committed embeddings stood in for the embed step.

143
00:09:15,267 --> 00:09:21,006
再加载：python cli.py --load，chunk type 用 char-split
Then the load step: python cli.py --load --chunk_type char-split.

144
00:09:21,326 --> 00:09:27,982
11 本书，8248 个 chunk；授课老师的故事只占其中 24 个
11 books, 8,248 chunks; the instructor's story is just 24 of them.

145
00:09:28,302 --> 00:09:31,729
一条额外的 --get 命令确认 collection 能正常响应
An extra --get command confirms the collection answers;

146
00:09:31,729 --> 00:09:33,329
暂停一下，加载你自己的
pause, and load yours.

147
00:09:36,650 --> 00:09:41,107
查完 collection 之后，agent 函数组装出用户这一轮
After the collection lookup, the agent function builds the user's turn:

148
00:09:41,107 --> 00:09:43,178
问题，角色是 user
the question, with the role user.

149
00:09:43,498 --> 00:09:45,781
接着是对 Gemini 的第一次调用
Then comes the first call to Gemini.

150
00:09:46,017 --> 00:09:49,384
三个设置：temperature 设为 0，菜单作为工具
Three settings: temperature zero, the menu as tools,

151
00:09:49,384 --> 00:09:51,585
以及一个 mode 设为 any 的 tool config
and a tool_config with mode="any".

152
00:09:51,905 --> 00:09:54,785
课上把 temperature 列为一个设计选择
The lecture lists temperature as a design choice.

153
00:09:55,105 --> 00:09:57,750
设为 0，工具的选择就几乎可以复现
Zero keeps the tool choice nearly repeatable.

154
00:09:57,983 --> 00:10:02,356
一行额外的命令显示，mode 设为 any 变成了什么：enum 值 ANY
An extra one-liner shows what mode="any" becomes: the enum value ANY.

155
00:10:02,676 --> 00:10:04,959
模型必须用一个函数调用来回答
The model must answer with a function call.

156
00:10:05,200 --> 00:10:09,199
在课上，一个好的 agent 可能决定根本不去搜索
In the lecture, a good agent may decide not to search at all;

157
00:10:09,199 --> 00:10:11,493
Self-RAG 就是从这个决定开始的
Self-RAG starts with that decision.

158
00:10:11,813 --> 00:10:15,291
我们的不行：在第 1 次调用里，mode 设为 any 会强制调用工具
Ours can't: on call 1, mode="any" forces a tool call.

159
00:10:15,611 --> 00:10:17,723
它选的是搜哪一个，从来不是搜不搜
It chooses which search, never whether.

160
00:10:17,967 --> 00:10:20,143
Gemini 实际收到的是什么？
What does Gemini actually receive?

161
00:10:20,463 --> 00:10:25,391
一个额外的脚本运行同样的代码，但把请求打印出来，而不是发出去
An extra script runs the same code, but prints the request instead of sending it.

162
00:10:25,711 --> 00:10:29,511
一个信封：问题、带着 enum 的两个声明
One envelope: the question, both declarations with the enum;

163
00:10:29,511 --> 00:10:31,727
mode 为 ANY，temperature 为 0
"mode": "ANY" and temperature zero.

164
00:10:31,967 --> 00:10:34,158
而且没有 system instruction
And no system instruction:

165
00:10:34,158 --> 00:10:38,793
和第 5 讲一样，cli.py 定义了一个，却从来没发出去
as in lecture 5, cli.py defines one and never sends it.

166
00:10:39,033 --> 00:10:41,742
现在再跑第 1 步，collection 已经加载了
Now step 1 again, with the collection loaded.

167
00:10:42,062 --> 00:10:47,418
查找通过了，问题也打印出来了，但第一次模型调用需要你的密钥
The lookup passes and the question prints, but the first model call needs your key:

168
00:10:47,418 --> 00:10:49,999
报 DefaultCredentialsError，找不到文件
DefaultCredentialsError, file not found.

169
00:10:50,233 --> 00:10:51,833
下面是课程团队看到的
Here's what the staff saw.

170
00:10:52,025 --> 00:10:54,879
模型的整个回答就是一个函数调用
The model's whole answer is a function call:

171
00:10:54,879 --> 00:10:58,122
get book by author，作者填的是授课老师
get_book_by_author, with the instructor as author,

172
00:10:58,122 --> 00:11:01,689
搜索文本是 cheese making importance location
and the search text, cheese making importance location.

173
00:11:01,933 --> 00:11:05,325
四个词，而描述要求的是一两句话
Four words, though the description asked for a sentence or two.

174
00:11:05,645 --> 00:11:08,200
还有一个 ID，以及一个 thought signature
There's also an ID, and a thought signature;

175
00:11:08,200 --> 00:11:09,633
我们之后还会再见到它
we'll meet it again.

176
00:11:09,683 --> 00:11:13,182
SDK 什么都没运行；它手里只有声明
The SDK ran nothing; it only has declarations.

177
00:11:13,502 --> 00:11:15,315
到目前为止，一次付费调用
So far, one paid call.

178
00:11:15,635 --> 00:11:18,110
在这里暂停，用你的密钥跑第 1 步
Pause here, and run step 1 with your key.

179
00:11:21,950 --> 00:11:25,677
回到你的 Python 里，分发器按名字匹配每个调用
Back in your Python, a dispatcher matches each call's name,

180
00:11:25,677 --> 00:11:31,678
用模型给的参数运行真正的函数，再把结果包装成函数响应
runs the real function with the model's arguments, and wraps the result as a function response.

181
00:11:31,917 --> 00:11:35,714
没有密钥时，一个额外的脚本把课程团队录下的调用
Without a key, an extra script feeds the staff's recorded call

182
00:11:35,714 --> 00:11:39,511
送进教程自己的分发器，对着我们的 collection 运行
through the tutorial's own dispatcher, against our collection.

183
00:11:39,750 --> 00:11:43,634
有一个替身：没有 Google，我们没法把搜索文本向量化
One stand-in: without Google we can't embed the search text,

184
00:11:43,634 --> 00:11:46,029
所以用一个已存 chunk 的向量来替代
so a stored chunk's vector stands in,

185
00:11:46,029 --> 00:11:49,201
这 10 个 chunk 可能和真实查询返回的不一样
and the 10 chunks may differ from a real query's.

186
00:11:49,450 --> 00:11:53,546
出来的是今天这个故事里的 10 个段落，讲的是 Mara 和 Anja
Out come 10 passages from today's story, about Mara and Anja.

187
00:11:53,866 --> 00:12:00,671
它们拼成一个 3509 个字符的字符串，作为响应钉在这个调用上
Joined into one string of 3,509 characters, they're stapled to the call as its response.

188
00:12:00,917 --> 00:12:02,680
第 2 次调用发送三样东西
Call 2 sends three things:

189
00:12:02,680 --> 00:12:07,765
问题、原封不动的模型自己那一轮，以及你的函数响应
the question, the model's own turn, unchanged, and your function responses.

190
00:12:08,085 --> 00:12:12,991
工具也再次一起发过去，但没有 tool config：mode 回到了自动
The tools go along again, but no tool_config: the mode is back to automatic.

191
00:12:13,233 --> 00:12:16,789
模型那一轮里面带着它的 thought signature
Inside, the model's turn carries its thought signature:

192
00:12:16,789 --> 00:12:21,638
Gemini 的思考模型会给自己的那一轮签名，并要求原样发回
Gemini's thinking models sign their turn, and want it back exactly as sent.

193
00:12:21,958 --> 00:12:24,689
原封不动地发回这一轮，封印就不会破
Resending the turn unchanged keeps the seal.

194
00:12:24,933 --> 00:12:26,440
课程团队拿到的回答呢？
The staff's answer?

195
00:12:26,490 --> 00:12:29,531
一个阿尔卑斯山谷、它的山洞，还有转场放牧
An Alpine valley, its caves, and transhumance,

196
00:12:29,531 --> 00:12:31,845
也就是牲畜随季节迁移
the seasonal movement of livestock.

197
00:12:32,165 --> 00:12:37,776
两次调用分别用了 247 和 1269 个 token
The two calls used 247 and 1,269 tokens.

198
00:12:38,017 --> 00:12:39,873
所以，是谁搜索了你的数据库？
So, who searched your database?

199
00:12:40,193 --> 00:12:42,828
Gemini 写出了调用，选了那本书
Gemini wrote the call and chose the book;

200
00:12:42,828 --> 00:12:45,078
你的 Python 运行了它，就在你的笔记本上
your Python ran it, on your laptop.

201
00:12:45,398 --> 00:12:49,622
每个问题要两次模型调用，加一次 embedding 调用，全都要付费
That's two model calls and one embedding call per question, all paid.

202
00:12:49,867 --> 00:12:52,497
可今天这一版的书里从没出现过转场放牧
But today's book never says transhumance,

203
00:12:52,497 --> 00:12:54,807
这次运行里的另外三个词也没有
nor three other words from this run:

204
00:12:54,807 --> 00:12:58,400
加入这份输出的那个 commit，同时重写了这本书
the commit that added this output also rewrote the book.

205
00:12:58,720 --> 00:13:01,344
课程团队的索引是用旧文本建的
The staff's index was built from the old text.

206
00:13:01,583 --> 00:13:06,959
你在今天这一版书上跑，会用到这样的段落：Mara、凝乳、奶酪轮
Your run on today's book draws on passages like these: Mara, the curd, the wheels.

207
00:13:07,279 --> 00:13:09,498
索引按加载进去的内容来回答
An index answers from what was loaded.

208
00:13:09,733 --> 00:13:13,771
一个小疏漏：README 说会打印回答
One small slip: the README promises the response,

209
00:13:13,771 --> 00:13:17,562
但第 478 行打印的是整个 response 对象
but line 478 prints the whole response object.

210
00:13:17,882 --> 00:13:20,528
改成打印 response.text，就只有回答了
Print response.text for just the answer.

211
00:13:20,767 --> 00:13:25,843
第 2 步链接到课程托管的 Cheese Agent Tool，录制时还在线
Step 2 links to the course's hosted Cheese Agent Tool, up at the time of recording;

212
00:13:25,843 --> 00:13:27,443
在 Chrome 里试试
try it in Chrome.

213
00:13:29,683 --> 00:13:32,755
课上的 agent 会一直运行，直到任务完成
The lecture's agent runs until the task is done.

214
00:13:33,075 --> 00:13:35,142
而 llm-rag 的 agent 只跑了一圈
llm-rag's agent ran one lap:

215
00:13:35,142 --> 00:13:37,726
一次强制的工具调用，然后一个回答
a forced tool call, then an answer.

216
00:13:38,046 --> 00:13:39,895
README 把它叫作 agent
The README calls it an agent;

217
00:13:39,895 --> 00:13:43,720
按课上的定义，它只是 agent 最小的一块
by the lecture's definition, it's the smallest piece of one.

218
00:13:43,966 --> 00:13:46,185
关于这一圈，有一个问题
Here's a question about that one lap.

219
00:13:55,033 --> 00:13:58,578
它打印出的 response 只有一个部分，就是函数调用
It prints a response whose only part is a function call,

220
00:13:58,578 --> 00:14:00,793
没有文本，然后程序就结束了
with no text, and the program ends.

221
00:14:01,113 --> 00:14:04,697
没有任何东西去执行这个调用；换成循环，就会执行它，再问一次
Nothing runs that call; a loop would run it, and ask again.

222
00:14:04,933 --> 00:14:07,371
课上把 agent 画成一个轮毂
The lecture draws the agent as a hub:

223
00:14:07,371 --> 00:14:13,893
核心和它的指令成为决策者，辐条通向规划器、工具和记忆
the core and its instructions become a decision maker, with spokes to a planner, tools, and memory.

224
00:14:14,213 --> 00:14:16,645
把通向工具的那根辐条展开，就成了一个循环
Unroll the spoke to the tools into a loop.

225
00:14:16,883 --> 00:14:18,390
循环靠什么结束？
What ends the loop?

226
00:14:18,440 --> 00:14:23,176
停止规则：一个不含函数调用的回复，就是最终回复
The stop rule: a reply with no function call is the final response.

227
00:14:23,496 --> 00:14:27,016
模型认定自己做完了，办法就是用纯文本回答
The model decides it's done by answering in plain text.

228
00:14:27,266 --> 00:14:29,822
在代码里，你是从外面看这个循环的
In code you see the loop from outside:

229
00:14:29,822 --> 00:14:31,840
ADK 的 Runner 以流的形式输出事件
the ADK Runner streams events,

230
00:14:31,840 --> 00:14:36,952
这个包装函数留下最终回复，循环本身在库里面运行
this wrapper keeps the final response, and the loop runs inside the library.

231
00:14:37,200 --> 00:14:40,047
你还要给它设个上限，以防它永远不停
You also cap it, in case it never stops:

232
00:14:40,047 --> 00:14:44,816
Cheese Quiz Guild 里是 12 轮，简报里是 16 次迭代
12 turns in the Cheese Quiz Guild, 16 iterations in the newsletter.

233
00:14:45,136 --> 00:14:48,805
碰到 Agents SDK 的上限，运行就会以报错结束
Hitting the Agents SDK cap ends the run with an error.

234
00:14:49,050 --> 00:14:52,357
课上的组件图把动态控制标成了灰色
The lecture's building blocks gray out dynamic control.

235
00:14:52,677 --> 00:14:56,261
你来配置模型、指令、工具和记忆
You configure the model, instructions, tools and memory;

236
00:14:56,261 --> 00:14:59,396
循环则是框架替你写好的那个组件
the loop is the block a framework writes for you.

237
00:14:59,633 --> 00:15:02,671
第二部分之前，先把它拆掉。输入 exit
Before part 2, tear down. Type exit;

238
00:15:02,671 --> 00:15:06,421
再用一条额外的 docker ps，会看到 Chroma 还在运行
an extra docker ps then shows Chroma still up,

239
00:15:06,421 --> 00:15:07,903
在 port 8000 上
on port 8000.

240
00:15:07,953 --> 00:15:11,836
然后运行 docker compose down：两条无害的警告之后，它就停了
Then docker compose down: two harmless warnings, and it stops.

241
00:15:12,150 --> 00:15:16,651
你的索引会留在磁盘上，而第二部分也要用 port 8000
Your index stays on disk, and part 2 also needs port 8000.

242
00:15:16,971 --> 00:15:18,564
暂停一下，把它拆掉
Pause and tear down.

243
00:15:18,614 --> 00:15:21,536
第二部分，由框架替我们跑这个循环
In part 2, a framework runs this loop for us.

244
00:15:24,583 --> 00:15:26,695
第二部分：循环归框架管
Part 2: frameworks own the loop.

245
00:15:27,015 --> 00:15:31,111
这次不用 Docker：Google 的 Agent Development Kit
No Docker this time: Google's Agent Development Kit runs

246
00:15:31,111 --> 00:15:33,671
跑在你笔记本上的一个 uv 环境里
in a uv environment on your laptop.

247
00:15:33,991 --> 00:15:36,636
打开一个新终端，进到你放 clone 的地方
Open a new terminal where you keep your clones.

248
00:15:36,883 --> 00:15:41,043
第 1 步：clone；README 里的地址写的是一个占位符
Step 1: clone; the README writes a placeholder for the address.

249
00:15:41,363 --> 00:15:46,504
下一行写的是：cd google-adk-tutorial，可是并没有这个目录
The next line says cd google-adk-tutorial, but no such folder exists.

250
00:15:46,750 --> 00:15:50,057
一个小疏漏：目录名和 repo 名一样
A small slip: the folder is named after the repo.

251
00:15:50,377 --> 00:15:53,726
改成输入：cd llm-agent-google-adk
Type cd llm-agent-google-adk instead.

252
00:15:53,966 --> 00:15:58,502
额外的 ls 显示有六个带编号的模块目录，但没有 lock 文件
An extra ls shows six numbered module folders, but no lock file:

253
00:15:58,502 --> 00:16:02,542
这个 repo 忽略了它，所以每个人都会重新解析出最新的版本
the repo ignores it, so everyone resolves fresh versions.

254
00:16:02,783 --> 00:16:06,026
接下来，把 .env.example 复制成 .env 文件
Next, copy .env.example to .env.

255
00:16:06,346 --> 00:16:10,514
额外的 grep 显示了一个占位的 Google API 密钥
An extra grep shows a placeholder Google API key,

256
00:16:10,514 --> 00:16:13,236
还有模型：gemini-2.5-flash
and the model, gemini-2.5-flash.

257
00:16:13,483 --> 00:16:16,707
然后在 Google AI Studio 里创建一个密钥
Then create a key in Google AI Studio,

258
00:16:16,707 --> 00:16:20,608
粘贴到 .env 里 Google API key 的等号后面
and paste it into .env, after GOOGLE_API_KEY=.

259
00:16:20,850 --> 00:16:22,621
模型那一行也要改
Also change the model line.

260
00:16:22,941 --> 00:16:29,365
选 LLM 核心是课上的第一个设计决定，而在这里它只是一行
Choosing the LLM core is the lecture's first design decision, and here it's one line:

261
00:16:29,365 --> 00:16:32,690
换成当前的模型，比如 gemini-3.1-flash-lite
a current model, like gemini-3.1-flash-lite.

262
00:16:32,933 --> 00:16:38,064
Google 把代码里的后备模型 gemini-2.0-flash 列为已停用
Google lists the code's fallback, gemini-2.0-flash, as shut down,

263
00:16:38,064 --> 00:16:41,616
又把 gemini-2.5-flash 限定给老用户使用
and limits gemini-2.5-flash to earlier users.

264
00:16:41,936 --> 00:16:44,123
所有设置都放在根目录这个文件里
Keep everything in this root file:

265
00:16:44,123 --> 00:16:46,181
只会加载离得最近的那个 .env 文件
only the nearest .env is loaded.

266
00:16:46,501 --> 00:16:48,144
暂停一下，把你的设置好
Pause, and set up yours.

267
00:16:50,383 --> 00:16:57,551
项目文件要求 Python 3.10 及以上、ADK 1.8 及以上，没有上限
The project file wants Python 3.10 or newer and ADK 1.8 or newer, with no upper bound.

268
00:16:57,871 --> 00:17:00,836
文件里还列了 Chroma 和 sentence-transformers
It also lists Chroma and sentence-transformers.

269
00:17:01,083 --> 00:17:04,368
再补充一点：这台笔记本上根本没有 Python
One more fact: this laptop has no Python at all.

270
00:17:11,216 --> 00:17:13,136
然后安装：uv sync
Then install: uv sync.

271
00:17:13,456 --> 00:17:16,998
和第 1 讲一样，周围没有 Python
As in lecture 1, with no Python around,

272
00:17:16,998 --> 00:17:22,992
uv 就下载最新的：录制时是 CPython 3.15.0
uv downloads the newest: CPython 3.15.0, at the time of recording.

273
00:17:23,233 --> 00:17:26,774
它解析了 189 个包，然后失败了
It resolves 189 packages, then fails.

274
00:17:27,094 --> 00:17:30,222
Chroma 引入的 onnxruntime
onnxruntime, which Chroma pulls in,

275
00:17:30,222 --> 00:17:33,260
只有到 Python 3.14 为止的 wheel
has wheels only up to Python 3.14.

276
00:17:33,500 --> 00:17:38,618
所以这一步只要 uv 选中 3.15 就会失败：在全新的笔记本上
So this step fails whenever uv picks 3.15: on a fresh laptop,

277
00:17:38,618 --> 00:17:43,484
或者 uv 已经有 3.15 的地方，哪怕旁边还有更旧的 Python
or where uv already has 3.15, even beside an older Python.

278
00:17:43,804 --> 00:17:48,412
修复办法是一条额外的命令：uv python pin 3.13
The fix, with an extra command: uv python pin 3.13.

279
00:17:49,850 --> 00:17:54,449
然后再跑一次：uv sync，这次用的是 CPython 3.13
Then uv sync again: CPython 3.13 this time,

280
00:17:54,449 --> 00:17:58,405
安装成功，ADK 2.12.0 也装上了
and it installs, ADK 2.12.0 included.

281
00:17:58,725 --> 00:18:00,487
PyTorch 让它变得很大
PyTorch makes it big:

282
00:18:00,487 --> 00:18:06,106
大约 1.6 GB，在 Linux 电脑上还要再加大约 3 GB 的 CUDA
about 1.6 gigabytes, plus about 3 gigabytes for CUDA on a Linux PC.

283
00:18:06,350 --> 00:18:13,923
额外检查一下：uv run adk --version，录制时显示 2.12.0
An extra check, uv run adk --version, says 2.12.0, at the time of recording.

284
00:18:14,243 --> 00:18:16,376
暂停一下，让你的 sync 跑成功
Pause, and get your sync to succeed.

285
00:18:19,717 --> 00:18:21,718
Running Agents 一节的第 1 步
Running Agents, step 1,

286
00:18:21,718 --> 00:18:25,285
在 repo 根目录下：uv run adk web
from the repository root: uv run adk web.

287
00:18:25,605 --> 00:18:30,518
首先，2.12 版会问一个问题，README 里没提
First, version 2.12 asks a question the README doesn't mention:

288
00:18:30,518 --> 00:18:32,858
可以让 Google 收集使用数据吗？
may Google collect usage data?

289
00:18:33,100 --> 00:18:35,981
提示文字说遥测默认是关闭的
The text says telemetry is off by default,

290
00:18:35,981 --> 00:18:39,479
可大写的 Y 意味着直接按回车就是回答 yes
but the capital Y means pressing enter answers yes.

291
00:18:39,799 --> 00:18:41,296
怎么回答都行
Answer as you like;

292
00:18:41,296 --> 00:18:43,977
以后可以用这条命令改
change it later with this command:

293
00:18:43,977 --> 00:18:46,263
uv run adk telemetry disable
uv run adk telemetry disable.

294
00:18:46,500 --> 00:18:49,273
然后服务器启动了，在 port 8000 上
Then the server starts, on port 8000.

295
00:18:49,593 --> 00:18:53,100
第 2 步：在浏览器里打开 localhost:8000
Step 2: open localhost:8000 in your browser;

296
00:18:53,100 --> 00:18:56,847
额外的 curl 显示它重定向到了 dev UI
an extra curl shows the redirect to the dev UI.

297
00:18:57,084 --> 00:19:01,265
这个 agent 下拉菜单列出了 7 项，嵌套的也算在内
The agent dropdown lists 7 entries, nested ones included.

298
00:19:01,585 --> 00:19:06,065
按它的 README 选 1-baseline，页面拒绝了
Pick 1-baseline, as its README says, and the page refuses:

299
00:19:06,065 --> 00:19:09,542
agent 名必须是合法的 Python 标识符
agent names must be valid Python identifiers.

300
00:19:09,784 --> 00:19:13,402
为什么？每个目录名都会变成 app 名
Why? Each folder name becomes the app's name,

301
00:19:13,402 --> 00:19:19,192
而标识符只能包含字母、数字和下划线，并且不能以数字开头
and an identifier holds only letters, digits and underscores, never starting with a digit.

302
00:19:19,512 --> 00:19:22,008
这个名字 1-baseline，两条规则都违反了
The name 1-baseline breaks both rules.

303
00:19:22,250 --> 00:19:27,455
旧版本 1.27.5 只列出那四个目录
An older version, 1.27.5, lists only the four folders.

304
00:19:27,775 --> 00:19:30,997
但选一个还是失败，原因是 app 名不合法
But picking one still fails, as an invalid app name.

305
00:19:31,317 --> 00:19:34,197
所以 pin 版本没用；我们也把自己的 pin 撤掉了
So a version pin doesn't help; we undid ours.

306
00:19:35,717 --> 00:19:39,045
管用的是改名，这也不在 README 里
What works is renaming, which isn't in the README either.

307
00:19:39,365 --> 00:19:43,425
先按 Ctrl-C 停掉服务器，再去掉每个开头的数字
Stop the server with Ctrl+C, then drop each leading number,

308
00:19:43,425 --> 00:19:45,765
把连字符换成下划线
and turn hyphens into underscores.

309
00:19:46,000 --> 00:19:48,731
再启动一次 web 服务器，选 baseline
Start the web server again, and pick baseline.

310
00:19:49,051 --> 00:19:52,882
日志说它加载了 repo 根目录下的 .env
The log says it loaded the .env at the repository root,

311
00:19:52,882 --> 00:19:55,878
并在 baseline.agent 里找到了 root agent
and found the root_agent in baseline.agent.

312
00:19:56,117 --> 00:20:00,891
还有两个小疏漏：快速入门在该传目录的地方传了一个文件
Two more slips: the quick start passes a file where a folder is expected,

313
00:20:00,891 --> 00:20:03,572
各模块的 README 又漏了 web 这个词
and the module READMEs drop the word web,

314
00:20:03,572 --> 00:20:05,172
所以命令只会打印帮助信息
so it only prints help.

315
00:20:05,317 --> 00:20:09,653
如果 llm-rag 的 Chroma 还占着 port 8000，两边就会冲突
And if llm-rag's Chroma still holds port 8000, they clash;

316
00:20:09,653 --> 00:20:13,168
web 服务器停了：address already in use
the web server stopped: address already in use.

317
00:20:13,488 --> 00:20:17,989
先运行 docker compose down，或者加上 --port 8080
Run docker compose down first, or add --port 8080.

318
00:20:18,309 --> 00:20:21,338
暂停一下，在 dev UI 里打开 baseline
Pause, and get the dev UI open on baseline.

319
00:20:24,683 --> 00:20:26,980
在 baseline 里，有三个 LLM agent
Baseline holds three LLM agents,

320
00:20:26,980 --> 00:20:30,784
每个都有一个模型、一条指令和一个 output key
each with a model, an instruction, and an output_key.

321
00:20:31,104 --> 00:20:36,075
对应课上的组件：LLM 核心、指令，完全没有工具
In the lecture's blocks: the LLM core, the instructions, and no tools at all.

322
00:20:36,616 --> 00:20:41,629
顺序 agent 依次运行它们：校验器、规划器、总结器
A sequential agent runs them in order: validator, planner, summarizer.

323
00:20:41,949 --> 00:20:45,163
一个额外的请求显示了 UI 加载的那棵树
An extra request shows the tree the UI loads,

324
00:20:45,163 --> 00:20:47,663
模型来自你根目录的 .env
with the model from your root .env;

325
00:20:47,663 --> 00:20:51,557
核对一下你的。另一个额外的请求创建了一个 session
check yours. Another extra request creates a session:

326
00:20:51,557 --> 00:20:53,929
状态是空的，也还没有事件
an empty state, and no events yet.

327
00:20:54,249 --> 00:20:56,553
把状态想成一块共享的白板
Think of the state as a shared whiteboard.

328
00:20:56,800 --> 00:20:59,211
等你加上密钥，Runner 就会这样做
Once you add your key, the Runner does this.

329
00:20:59,531 --> 00:21:03,608
校验器的回复写进状态，放在它的 output key 下面
The validator's reply goes into the state, under its output_key;

330
00:21:03,608 --> 00:21:08,704
规划器运行之前，它指令里的占位符会用那一格的内容填上
before the planner runs, its instruction's placeholder is filled from that cell.

331
00:21:09,566 --> 00:21:12,361
总结器也用同样的方式读取计划
The summarizer reads the plan the same way.

332
00:21:12,681 --> 00:21:14,697
这些 agent 从不互相调用
The agents never call each other:

333
00:21:14,697 --> 00:21:18,910
数据由 session 携带，放在它的状态和事件历史里
the session carries the data, in its state and its history of events.

334
00:21:19,230 --> 00:21:21,833
并行 agent 会同时填满它的格子
A parallel agent fills its cells at once.

335
00:21:22,083 --> 00:21:24,707
课上的旅行规划需要实时系统
The lecture's planner needs live systems;

336
00:21:24,707 --> 00:21:28,931
这条 pipeline 没有工具，所以里面的价格都是模型猜的
this pipeline has no tools, so its prices are the model's guesses.

337
00:21:29,251 --> 00:21:33,176
后面一个 notebook 的价格来自工具，总和由 Python 计算
A later notebook gets prices from tools and sums from Python.

338
00:21:33,716 --> 00:21:36,127
ADK 的 README 把这叫作记忆
The ADK README calls this memory.

339
00:21:36,447 --> 00:21:40,159
代码里叫它 session 状态，只持续一个 session
The code calls it session state, and it lasts one session;

340
00:21:40,159 --> 00:21:45,151
课上说的记忆，下次还会记得你，而今天的运行一个都做不到
the lecture's memory remembers you next time, which none of today's runs does.

341
00:21:45,400 --> 00:21:49,560
没有真正的密钥，旅行请求会得到 Internal Server Error
Without a real key, a trip request gets an Internal Server Error.

342
00:21:49,880 --> 00:21:53,144
服务器日志说明了原因：API key not valid
The server log says why: API key not valid.

343
00:21:53,464 --> 00:21:56,322
占位密钥发到了 Google，被拒绝了
The placeholder reached Google, and was refused.

344
00:21:57,366 --> 00:22:00,359
有密钥的话，要找的是：按顺序的三条回复
With your key, look for three replies in order,

345
00:22:00,359 --> 00:22:02,842
以及 State 标签页里新增的三项
and three new entries in the State tab;

346
00:22:02,842 --> 00:22:05,643
这个 session 是 agent 目录里的一个文件
the session is a file in the agent's folder.

347
00:22:05,963 --> 00:22:09,804
每个请求是三次模型调用：暂停一下，规划一次旅行
Each request is three model calls: pause, and plan a trip.

348
00:22:13,150 --> 00:22:15,710
课上把工具分成三类
The lecture sorts tools into three families.

349
00:22:16,030 --> 00:22:18,918
数据工具负责获取，比如我们的搜书工具
Data tools fetch, like our book searches;

350
00:22:18,918 --> 00:22:23,919
行动工具会改变某些东西，比如敲定行程或者发邮件
action tools change something, like finalizing a trip or sending email;

351
00:22:23,919 --> 00:22:27,230
编排工具把工作交给另一个 agent
orchestration tools hand work to another agent.

352
00:22:27,467 --> 00:22:31,947
现在把一个 agent 接到十个服务上，每个服务都有自己的协议
Now wire one agent to ten services, each with its own protocol.

353
00:22:32,267 --> 00:22:34,741
课上问：你看出问题了吗？
The lecture asks: do you see a problem?

354
00:22:39,983 --> 00:22:42,564
每个工具都要做一次定制集成
Every tool becomes a custom integration.

355
00:22:42,884 --> 00:22:46,958
MCP，也就是模型上下文协议，把它变成一种模式
MCP, the Model Context Protocol, makes it one pattern:

356
00:22:46,958 --> 00:22:51,183
一个 host 带着若干 client，每个服务对应一个 MCP server
a host with clients, and an MCP server for each service.

357
00:22:51,433 --> 00:22:56,084
课上那个 MCP 方框是一个共享的协议，不是一个要你运行的程序
The lecture's MCP box is a shared protocol, not a program you run.

358
00:22:56,404 --> 00:23:00,457
在代码里，每个 server 都是一个单独的插头，教程里有三个
In code, each server is its own plug, and the tutorial has three.

359
00:23:00,700 --> 00:23:04,049
第 1 个插头在 ADK 讲 MCP 的那个模块里
Plug 1 is in the ADK module on MCP.

360
00:23:04,369 --> 00:23:05,969
安装 Node
Install Node.

361
00:23:08,683 --> 00:23:12,652
这个 agent 的工具集用 npx 启动一个文件系统 server
The agent's toolset starts a filesystem server with npx,

362
00:23:12,652 --> 00:23:16,833
作为子进程；它通过标准输入输出通信
as a child process, talking over standard input and output.

363
00:23:17,083 --> 00:23:21,712
一个额外的脚本向这个工具集要它的工具列表，完全不涉及模型
An extra script asks that toolset for its tools, with no model involved.

364
00:23:22,032 --> 00:23:27,131
这个 server 提供 14 个，包括写入和编辑，过滤器放行了三个
The server offers 14, including write and edit, and the filter lets three through.

365
00:23:27,451 --> 00:23:30,097
有密钥的话，让 agent 列出文件
With your key, ask the agent to list files.

366
00:23:32,333 --> 00:23:34,338
第 2 个插头回到 Cheese Quiz 里
Plug 2 is back in the Cheese Quiz.

367
00:23:34,658 --> 00:23:38,350
先是第一个工具，写成普通函数
After a first tool written as a plain function,

368
00:23:38,350 --> 00:23:42,435
然后 notebook 按 URL 连上一个远程 MCP server
the notebook connects to a remote MCP server by URL,

369
00:23:42,435 --> 00:23:45,027
作为 MCP servers 参数传进去，而不是 tools
passed as mcp_servers, not tools.

370
00:23:45,267 --> 00:23:47,699
额外的几条 curl 命令和这个 server 对话
Extra curl commands talk to that server.

371
00:23:48,019 --> 00:23:50,979
浏览器的普通请求得到 406
A browser's plain request gets 406:

372
00:23:50,979 --> 00:23:55,038
server 在运行，但它说的是 MCP，不是网页
the server is up, but speaks MCP, not web pages.

373
00:23:55,358 --> 00:23:57,481
然后是初始化、列出工具、调用
Then initialize, list tools, call:

374
00:23:57,481 --> 00:23:59,667
一个工具，每次调用一条奶酪冷知识
one tool, one cheese fact per call.

375
00:24:01,417 --> 00:24:03,152
第 3 个插头是可选的
Plug 3 is optional:

376
00:24:03,152 --> 00:24:06,894
这个 notebook 自己起一个 FastMCP server
the notebook runs its own FastMCP server,

377
00:24:06,894 --> 00:24:09,268
跑在一个线程里，在 port 8001 上
in a thread, on port 8001.

378
00:24:09,588 --> 00:24:15,241
一个小疏漏：上面的注释写的是 8000，一份较早保存的输出也是
A small slip: the comment above says 8000, and so does an older saved output.

379
00:24:19,833 --> 00:24:22,884
注意是谁在负责通信：你的 client 进程
Notice who does the talking: your client process.

380
00:24:23,204 --> 00:24:28,025
MCP 并没有给模型任何网络访问权限；它仍然只是写出调用
MCP gives the model no network access; it still only writes calls.

381
00:24:28,345 --> 00:24:30,564
暂停一下，把 MCP 的单元格跑一遍
Pause, and run the MCP cells.

382
00:24:33,900 --> 00:24:37,275
课上的深度研究是一棵 agent 树
In the lecture, deep research is a tree of agents:

383
00:24:37,275 --> 00:24:40,515
一个主 agent、一个规划器、几个并行的网页搜索 agent
a lead agent, a planner, parallel web searchers,

384
00:24:40,515 --> 00:24:42,540
最后汇总成一份报告
and a synthesis into a report.

385
00:24:42,860 --> 00:24:47,276
教程搭了类似的树：Cheese Quiz Guild，还有简报
The tutorial builds trees like it: the Cheese Quiz Guild, and the newsletter.

386
00:24:47,517 --> 00:24:52,061
课上的规划器引出了区分它们的问题：顺序由谁来定？
The lecture's planner raises the question that sorts them: who plans the order?

387
00:24:52,381 --> 00:24:54,066
第一种答案：代码
First answer: the code.

388
00:24:54,386 --> 00:24:58,909
顺序 agent 就是一条流水线，顺序在 Python 里写死
The sequential agent is an assembly line, its order fixed in Python.

389
00:25:00,717 --> 00:25:02,466
第二种答案：模型
Second answer: the model.

390
00:25:02,786 --> 00:25:05,824
在 Guild 里，每个专家 agent 都变成一个工具
In the Guild, each specialist becomes a tool:

391
00:25:05,824 --> 00:25:08,120
一个函数背后是一整个 agent
a whole agent behind one function.

392
00:25:08,440 --> 00:25:10,914
由一个编排 agent 决定调用哪一个
An orchestrator decides which to call.

393
00:25:11,150 --> 00:25:16,334
它的指令写着：严格按流水线来，最多 2 轮审查
Its instructions say: follow the assembly line strictly, at most 2 review rounds.

394
00:25:16,654 --> 00:25:18,290
这是写在文字里的规则
That's a rule in prose;

395
00:25:18,290 --> 00:25:21,561
没有代码去强制执行它，除了 12 轮的上限
no code enforces it, except a cap of 12 turns.

396
00:25:21,800 --> 00:25:25,683
课程团队保存的运行报了三次获取回复的错误
The staff's saved run logged three errors getting a response,

397
00:25:25,683 --> 00:25:27,338
却还是生成了一份测验
and still produced a quiz;

398
00:25:27,338 --> 00:25:29,821
日志没说是哪些调用失败了
the log doesn't say which calls failed.

399
00:25:30,141 --> 00:25:33,117
每多一跳，就多一份成本、一段时间和一种失败的可能
Every hop adds cost, time, and a way to fail;

400
00:25:33,117 --> 00:25:34,771
暂停一下，跑一遍 Guild
pause, and run the Guild.

401
00:25:38,917 --> 00:25:41,968
第三种答案：Python，读取模型给的标签
Third answer: Python, reading the model's label.

402
00:25:42,288 --> 00:25:46,353
在这个自定义 agent 里，一个分类器往状态里写一个词
In this custom agent, a classifier writes one word into the state,

403
00:25:46,353 --> 00:25:48,879
再由普通的 if 语句选出处理函数
and plain if statements pick the handler.

404
00:25:55,717 --> 00:25:57,786
走的是 else 分支：clarification
The else branch: clarification.

405
00:25:58,106 --> 00:26:03,589
比较是精确匹配；先把标签转成小写，或者要求结构化输出
The comparison is exact; lowercase the label first, or ask for structured output.

406
00:26:03,909 --> 00:26:05,679
练习里两种办法都会试
The exercises try both.

407
00:26:07,417 --> 00:26:11,150
课上还把交接也列进了编排工具
The lecture also lists handoffs among the orchestration tools.

408
00:26:11,470 --> 00:26:16,121
这些教程是把 agent 当工具用；第 7 讲会简单讲讲交接
These tutorials use agents as tools; lecture 7 sketches handoffs.

409
00:26:17,167 --> 00:26:20,346
Travel Planner 这个 notebook 演练的是课上那趟旅行
The Travel Planner notebook rehearses the lecture's trip.

410
00:26:20,666 --> 00:26:24,484
复制一份，加上你的密钥，再安装它 pin 了版本的 agents 包
Copy it, add your key, and install its pinned agents package.

411
00:26:24,804 --> 00:26:27,249
巴黎缩成了一份模拟清单
Paris shrinks to a mock catalog:

412
00:26:27,249 --> 00:26:31,312
3 个城市、6 家酒店、5 个搜索工具和一个 finalize 工具
3 cities, 6 hotels, 5 search tools and a finalize tool,

413
00:26:31,312 --> 00:26:32,867
什么都不会真的预订
booking nothing.

414
00:26:32,917 --> 00:26:36,821
在课程团队保存的运行里，第 1 轮问的是加州的哪个城市
In the staff's saved run, turn 1 asks which California city.

415
00:26:37,141 --> 00:26:40,256
第 2 轮做了五次搜索，给出几个选项
Turn 2 runs five searches and offers options.

416
00:26:40,576 --> 00:26:44,078
第 3 轮里用户做出选择，模型调用 finalize
In turn 3 the user picks, the model calls finalize,

417
00:26:44,078 --> 00:26:47,786
回复里列出确切的计划，并请用户回答 yes
and the reply shows the exact plan and asks for a yes.

418
00:26:48,034 --> 00:26:49,392
这就是关卡
That's the gate.

419
00:26:49,442 --> 00:26:52,782
模型发起的 finalize 调用只能提议
A finalize call from the model can only propose:

420
00:26:52,782 --> 00:26:57,374
如果计划不是已批准的那一份，代码就把它存为待批准
if the plan isn't the approved one, the code stores it as pending,

421
00:26:57,374 --> 00:26:59,532
并返回 needs confirmation
and returns needs_confirmation.

422
00:26:59,767 --> 00:27:03,759
批准放在另一个函数 apply confirmation 里
Approval lives in a separate function, apply_confirmation:

423
00:27:03,759 --> 00:27:07,063
只有明确的 yes，才会把待批准的计划复制为已批准
only an explicit yes copies pending to approved.

424
00:27:16,500 --> 00:27:19,975
因为 apply confirmation 处理的是人发来的消息
Because apply_confirmation runs on the human's message,

425
00:27:19,975 --> 00:27:21,575
在 agent 启动之前运行
before the agent starts.

426
00:27:21,812 --> 00:27:26,719
在第 3 轮里，什么都没被批准，所以每次重试都会盖上同一个印章
Inside turn 3, nothing is approved, so every retry gets the same stamp.

427
00:27:26,967 --> 00:27:29,100
第 4 轮：人输入 yes
Turn 4: the human types yes.

428
00:27:29,420 --> 00:27:33,138
印章翻成已批准，finalize 运行
The stamp flips to approved, finalize runs,

429
00:27:33,138 --> 00:27:39,191
Python 逐行算出预算：2690 美元，上限 6000
and Python builds the budget line by line: 2,690 of the 6,000 dollars.

430
00:27:39,511 --> 00:27:42,348
这个 notebook 自带的测试核对 Python 算出的数
The notebook's own test checks Python's number.

431
00:27:42,584 --> 00:27:46,232
用户看到的内容来自检查过的状态，而不是模型写的文字
What the user sees comes from checked state, not the model's prose.

432
00:27:46,552 --> 00:27:51,328
跳过检查的行程会抛出异常，这是硬护栏
An itinerary that skipped the check raises an error, a hard guardrail;

433
00:27:51,328 --> 00:27:56,173
模型文字里出现美元金额，只会打印一条警告，这是软护栏
a dollar amount in the model's prose only prints a warning, a soft one.

434
00:27:56,417 --> 00:28:02,049
课上把成功标准放在指令里，把护栏放在决策者里
The lecture puts success criteria in the instructions, and guardrails in the decision maker.

435
00:28:02,369 --> 00:28:06,194
这个 notebook 把两者都写进代码，模型怎么说都绕不过去
This notebook keeps both in code the model can't talk its way past,

436
00:28:06,194 --> 00:28:07,794
代码就放在行动工具上
on the action tool.

437
00:28:07,958 --> 00:28:11,158
每一轮都要付费；暂停一下，把这四轮跑一遍
Every turn is paid; pause, and run the four turns.

438
00:28:14,200 --> 00:28:17,004
最后一个 notebook 给每位读者写一份奶酪简报
The last notebook writes a cheese newsletter per reader,

439
00:28:17,004 --> 00:28:19,960
用的是 Microsoft 的 Agent Framework，版本 pin 住了
with Microsoft's Agent Framework, pinned.

440
00:28:20,280 --> 00:28:24,163
在 USERS 单元格里，填上你自己和一个朋友，保留两项
In the USERS cell, put in yourself and a friend, and keep two entries.

441
00:28:24,483 --> 00:28:27,213
邮件只是预览；什么都不会发出去
Email is preview only; nothing is sent.

442
00:28:27,450 --> 00:28:29,610
编排 agent 有三个工具
The orchestrator gets three tools:

443
00:28:29,610 --> 00:28:33,167
一个带网页搜索的研究员、一个编辑，以及 send email
a researcher with web search, an editor, and send_email.

444
00:28:33,487 --> 00:28:36,858
最多 16 次迭代，一次只做一个工具调用
At most 16 iterations, one tool call at a time.

445
00:28:37,100 --> 00:28:41,215
在课程团队保存的运行里，第一个城市用了四次编辑调用
In the staff's saved run, the first city took four editor calls;

446
00:28:41,215 --> 00:28:46,231
代码会校验每份草稿，把任何错误都作为工具的结果交回去
the code validates every draft and hands any errors back as the tool's result.

447
00:28:46,551 --> 00:28:49,452
然后 send email 把 HTML 写进了一个文件
Then send_email wrote the HTML to a file.

448
00:28:49,772 --> 00:28:52,908
那次运行有四位读者；今天的名单是两位
That run had four readers; today's list makes two.

449
00:28:53,150 --> 00:28:54,572
现在来看 harness
Now the harness.

450
00:28:54,622 --> 00:28:59,510
编排 agent 停下来以后，Python 不管它说了什么，检查两件事
When the orchestrator stops, Python ignores its words and checks two things:

451
00:28:59,510 --> 00:29:03,433
有没有来自 send email 的回执，那个文件在不在磁盘上？
is there a receipt from send_email, and is that file on disk?

452
00:29:03,753 --> 00:29:05,295
如果没有，这次运行就算失败
If not, the run fails;

453
00:29:05,295 --> 00:29:07,678
成功看的是回执，而不是它声称了什么
success is a receipt, not a claim.

454
00:29:07,917 --> 00:29:10,456
对比一下只写在 prompt 里的规则
Compare a rule that lives only in the prompt.

455
00:29:10,776 --> 00:29:13,784
编辑收到的指令是：不要嵌入 URL
The editor is told: no embedded URLs.

456
00:29:14,104 --> 00:29:19,693
保存的预览里还是有一个，因为没有代码去检查；便条不等于检查
The saved preview has one anyway, because no code checks for it; a note is not a check.

457
00:29:19,933 --> 00:29:23,926
课上的 Self-RAG 和 Corrective RAG 给检索结果打分
The lecture's Self-RAG and Corrective RAG grade their retrieval

458
00:29:23,926 --> 00:29:26,461
也是出于同样的理由：别信，要查
for the same reason: don't trust, check.

459
00:29:26,781 --> 00:29:29,405
下节课把这个外层叫作 harness
Next lecture calls this outer layer the harness.

460
00:29:29,725 --> 00:29:33,117
网页搜索按次计费；暂停一下，跑一遍演示
Web search is billed per call; pause, and run the demo.

461
00:29:36,167 --> 00:29:38,983
该拆掉了：按 Ctrl-C 停掉 web 服务器
Tear down: Ctrl+C stops the web server.

462
00:29:39,303 --> 00:29:43,806
额外的 git status 显示了改名后的目录，还有你的 Python pin
An extra git status shows the renamed folders and your Python pin;

463
00:29:43,806 --> 00:29:47,900
而 .env 文件、虚拟环境和 lock 文件，都被忽略了
.env, the virtual environment and the lock file are ignored.

464
00:29:48,134 --> 00:29:52,018
这个 agent 的 .adk 目录里，session 没有被忽略
The sessions in the agent's .adk/ folder aren't ignored,

465
00:29:52,018 --> 00:29:58,054
所以别 commit 它们，用完以后把 1.6 GB 的虚拟环境删掉
so don't commit them, and delete the 1.6 gigabyte virtual environment when you're done.

466
00:29:58,300 --> 00:30:01,415
在每个 notebook 里，断开连接并删除运行时
In each notebook, disconnect and delete the runtime.

467
00:30:01,735 --> 00:30:05,735
服务账号密钥放在 llm-rag 旁边，绝不放进去
Keep the service account key beside llm-rag, never inside,

468
00:30:05,735 --> 00:30:09,735
课程结束时把另外两个密钥删掉，或者给它们设上限
and delete or cap the other two keys when the course ends.

469
00:30:10,984 --> 00:30:14,163
这是课上的 agent 结构图，填上了今天的代码
Here's the lecture's anatomy, filled with today's code.

470
00:30:14,483 --> 00:30:17,541
核心是 Gemini 和 OpenAI 的模型
Gemini and OpenAI models as the core;

471
00:30:17,541 --> 00:30:20,930
指令是 prompt 和输出类型
prompts and output types as instructions;

472
00:30:20,930 --> 00:30:24,072
工具有手写的、加装饰器的，或者走 MCP 的
tools by hand, decorated, or over MCP;

473
00:30:24,072 --> 00:30:27,048
记忆是消息历史和 session 状态
history and session state as memory.

474
00:30:27,284 --> 00:30:31,295
动态控制就是框架的循环，或者手写的两次调用
Dynamic control is the framework's loop, or two calls by hand.

475
00:30:31,615 --> 00:30:37,528
课上的公式，LLM 加上推理、指令和工具，多了两块
The lecture's formula, LLM plus reasoning, instructions and tools, gains two pieces:

476
00:30:37,528 --> 00:30:42,174
框架运行的循环，以及由你的代码强制执行的检查
a loop the framework runs, and checks that your own code enforces.

477
00:30:42,417 --> 00:30:43,796
自测一下
Test yourself.

478
00:30:43,846 --> 00:30:47,430
第一题：谁来运行这个函数，第 2 次调用里又发回什么？
One: who runs the function, and what goes back in call 2?

479
00:30:47,750 --> 00:30:49,877
第二题：mode 设为 any 改变了什么
Two: what does mode="any" change,

480
00:30:49,877 --> 00:30:51,477
为什么只在第 1 次调用上？
and why only on call 1?

481
00:30:51,617 --> 00:30:53,569
第三题：agent 循环靠什么结束
Three: what ends an agent loop,

482
00:30:53,569 --> 00:30:56,844
框架加了什么上限，那又是哪个组件？
what cap do frameworks add, and which block is that?

483
00:30:57,164 --> 00:31:00,492
第四题：总结器怎么在没有消息的情况下拿到计划？
Four: how does the summarizer get the plan without a message?

484
00:31:00,734 --> 00:31:03,726
第五题：什么决定一次 harness 运行成功了
Five: what decides that a harness run succeeded,

485
00:31:03,726 --> 00:31:05,534
为什么不是模型说了算？
and why not the model's word?

486
00:31:05,854 --> 00:31:10,163
答案和每条命令都在练习和学习指南里
Answers and every command are in the exercises and the study guide.

487
00:31:10,483 --> 00:31:12,744
下节课：harness 本身
Next lecture: the harness itself.
